# Copy to .redline-terms and fill in. .redline-terms is gitignored and must
# stay that way: committing the list of words you are hiding publishes them.
#
# One term per line, case-insensitive substring match. Lines starting with # are
# ignored. Include the forms that actually appear in text — a bare company name
# will not catch its domain, so list both.
#
# acme-industries
# acmeindustries.com
# northgate-logistics
